<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0136_D48R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You KNOW? They buildin’ a Safari Zone\nRIGHT around\fthe corner!\rIt’s gon’ be SO fun! You gon’ see MAD\nhomies, and it’s all you\fcan catch! LIKE A BUFFET!\rAin’t no reason not to go, RIGHT?! I’m\nSO HYPE! I ain’t slept in DAYS!\rFINISH THE CONSTRUCTION ALREADY!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0136_D48R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You KNOW? There’s a Safari Zone RIGHT\naround the corner!\rIt’s SO fun! MAD homies, all you can\ncatch! LIKE A BUFFET!\rAin’t no reason not to go, RIGHT?!\nRight around the corner!\rIt won’t take long. Why don’t you\nstop by? Huh? HUH? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0136_D48R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AIGHT! It’s RIGHT over there!\rUp the stairs and outside.\nThen a few steps! You’ll LOVE it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0136_D48R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s SUCH a good deal, you know?\nI get commission. Not that that\fmatters. It’s 2%. It matters.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0136_D48R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">See?! The Safari Zone was FUN?\nDon’t say nothin’!\fYour face say it ALL!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0136_D48R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What? You wanna go to the Safari Zone\ntoo?\rIt’s still under construction. Baoba\nsaid two weeks. Eight months ago.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0136_D48R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I appreciate everybody bein’ hype for\nit. But the lady at the desk a lil TOO\fdramatic... She been yellin’ for a\fmonth. I bought earplugs. She louder.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0136_D48R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chuck: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nGood to see you again! But I never\fthought I’d see you out here.\rCould it be...you on the way\nto the Embedded Tower?\rThe Embedded Tower is a huge tower\npiercin’ the sky.\rThey say it got somethin’ to do with\nthe mythical homie that stretched\fthe seas and the homie that widened\fthe land.\rBut the tower ain’t standin’ no more.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0136_D48R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chuck: The way to the Embedded Tower\nis harder than you can imagine.\rYou need Parkour\nAND Ride Da Wave.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0136_D48R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chuck: I see! So you beat all\nthe Block Bosses in Kanto too!\rThen ain’t nothin’ to worry about.\nBelieve in yourself and keep walkin’.\rYahaha!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0136_D48R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Everything Is Thrillin’!\nExplore to Find Wild Homies!\rWarden Baoba’s Safari Zone\nComin’ Soon! (Prob’ly!)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0136_D48R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Everything Is Thrillin’!\nExplore to Find Wild Homies!\rWarden Baoba’s Safari Zone\nUp and Runnin’! (Mostly!)</language>
	</row>
</body>
